 hc   Keys · problems
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   enter                  open
   v                      view
   e                      edit
   h                      history
   m                      star
   /                      search; id:707 | id:70* | id:700..800
   f                      filter
   c                      group
   a                      add-to-group
   L                      lang
   i                      locale
   y                      copy-path
   r                      reset
   D                      discard
   q                      quit
   ctrl+n/p               move in search
   ctrl+o                 open in search
   j/k,↓/↑                next/previous item or text line
   ctrl+e/y               scroll down/up one line
   ctrl+d/u               half page (move selection with view)
   ctrl+f/b,pgdown/pgup   page down/up (2-line overlap)
   g/G,home/end           first/last
   :                      command
   ?                      help
   ctrl+c                 quit

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
q / esc / ? close
